к за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/ikonomika\">← <!-- -->Икономика</a></p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Кръвоносната система на икономиката</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Откъде идват парите, през кои сектори минават и при кого остават. Кое носи печалба и кое потъва. Данни: национални сметки на Евростат за 2025 г., НАП, АППК, ИСУН.</div></div></div><section class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Как се разпределя създаденото</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Всеки сектор създава стойност, която се разделя на заплати и осигуровки за наетите и на всичко останало: печалби на фирмите, доходи на самонаетите и наемите. Данъците върху продуктите отиват при държавата. Общо: <!-- -->116,5 млрд. €<!-- --> БВП за <!-- -->2025<!-- --> г.</p><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden relative\"><svg width=\"900\" height=\"560\" class=\"block max-w-full\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Паричен поток\"><defs><pattern id=\"hatch\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#e7efea\"></rect><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#9aa39e\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line></pattern></defs><path d=\"M17,85.59577651859658C350,85.59577651859658,350,51.95201571621778,683,51.95201571621778\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f6f8f\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"3.4612984820040427\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,89.82433392479005C350,89.82433392479005,350,221.7484367739071,683,221.7484367739071\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f6f8f\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"4.9958163303829135\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,22.45646272278298C350,22.45646272278298,350,35.76490375243278,683,35.76490375243278\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"28.91292544556596\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,50.38902636158025C350,50.38902636158025,350,